#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-mavlink.rst:22
#: 6a7e024a5d2f41b1bba29faa5c136bb3
msgid "This project provides airborne (autopilot-> RX SPort), ground (TX module telem output -> TX SPort input), and relay station applications using inexpensive Teensy, ESP, ESP8266, and HelTec WIFI cpu boards. It also provides Bluetooth and WIFI output options to allow parallel connections to Ground Control stations in the ground and relay modes. It is currently well supported."
